WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.600
Mom, dad, I don't want to be a Dutchman anymore.

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:04.600
My heart beats for Morocco.

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:08.000
What are you saying? You were born in a Dutch family.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Your family background flows through your veins.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.600
I don't want to be a cheese head anymore. I want to go to Morocco.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:15.000
There is sun, couscous and fun.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.400
Look at that dad there. Do you still think you are the boss?

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Doctor, make sure I become a real Moroccan.

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:26.600
Without your parents' signature, I can't do anything for you.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.600
Mom, dad, please, put that rattle on.

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:32.600
Then I finally belong to the culture of my dreams.

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:34.600
No talking about it. Never about my life.

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:37.600
In this house I eat a stamp pot, not couscous.

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:45.600
Now that the paperwork is done, we start your transformation to Moroccan.

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:50.600
Our little cheese head is nowhere to be seen.

00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:53.600
We have to call the police. This is going completely wrong.

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:54.600
The operation is successful.

00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:57.600
Once a Moroccan, always a Moroccan.

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:01.200
I can't wait to show my new self to my parents!

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:03.200
Voila! Part 2 is going to be epic!
